<title>UK: IBCA rates Helaba unit's notes due 2002.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates Helaba unit's notes due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Thursday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to Helaba International Finance Plc, Dublin's 200 million stg 7.375 percent notes due 2002.</p>
<p>The issue is guaranteed by Landesbank Hessen-Thueringen Girozentrale.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of the Landesbank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
